course: dictionary
lesson: 9768
title: Sure: one word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word sure can mean different things, so the words around it tell you which meaning to use. Look at the words next to it first.
explain: «Make sure» means check or take care that something happens. «Nobody knows for sure» means nobody is certain. Both meanings come from the same idea: there is no doubt.
explain: In speech, «Sure, you can borrow it» means yes, of course. «I'm not sure» shows that you are not certain. Read the whole sentence before you decide what sure means.
fact: Sure is an adjective and an adverb: sure, surer, surest.
fact: If you are sure, you know something is true and have no doubt.
fact: «Make sure» means check or take care that something happens.
fact: In speech, «sure» means yes, of course.
fact: A sure thing is something certain to happen.
exercise: «Foster carers are checked and trained, and social workers visit to make sure children are safe.» What does make sure mean here? | *Check or take care that something happens | Tell the children a secret | Move the children to a new house | Forget about the children
exercise: «Some scientists now think life on Earth may have started at vents, but nobody knows for sure.» What does for sure mean? | *Certainly, with no doubt | Quickly and loudly | Only in the sea | Once a year
exercise: Sam asks, «Can I borrow your pen?» Ella says, «Sure, you can borrow it.» What does sure mean in her answer? | Very old | Made of glass | *Yes, of course
test: When you get off the bus, you «make sure» your bag straps do not catch on the door. What does make sure mean here? | Pull the straps hard | Sing a song | *Check or take care that something happens | Forget to check
test: Which of these is a sure thing? | Something you lose | *Something certain to happen | Something that might happen | Something that never happens
exam: Mia says, «I'm not sure», so she knows the answer for certain. Is she right? | *No, she has doubt | Yes, she is angry | No, she is asleep | Yes, she is certain
